# CLAUDE.md

This repository is the `{{skillSlug}}` Claude skill. It is installed by cloning it to
`~/.claude/skills/{{skillSlug}}/`.

- To use the skill, follow [SKILL.md](SKILL.md).
- To change the skill itself, read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) first.

Before committing, run `npm run lint:all` and `npm test`. The Git hooks run them too once `npm install` has
installed the hooks.
